# Dreambox from the command line, against tests/boxserver.py: make a directory,
# write a file through an open handle, read it back, save and load memory,
# list, rename and delete. The last shot is the checked one.
70 key 0 12 1
70.1 key 0 12 0
73 type cdir dreambox:$.Work\n
80 type spool dreambox:$.Work.Note\n
84 type echo Hello from the Dreambox\n
88 type spool\n
92 type type dreambox:$.Work.Note\n
98 type save dreambox:$.Work.Mem 8000 +9000\n
106 type load dreambox:$.Work.Mem 20000\n
114 type settype dreambox:$.Work.Note text\n
118 type rename dreambox:$.Work.Mem dreambox:$.Work.Block\n
124 type info dreambox:$.Work.*\n
132 type delete dreambox:$.Work.Block\n
138 type ex dreambox:$.Work\n
146 shot build/box1.ppm
